# Historical release acceptance/deployment records belong in Git history or the release archive, not main
R*_ACCEPTANCE*.md
R*_FINAL_*RECORD*.md
R*_LIVE_DEPLOYMENT_MARKER.md
R*_CANDIDATE*.md
R*_EDUSENTIA_*IDENTITY.md
R*_DEPLOYMENT*.md

# Temporary release assembly payloads should not return to production main
*-generator-payload/
